    "flavor_text": {
      "one_line": "Erainn — wary feudal of the forest; law, honor.",
      "one_paragraph": "The Erainn (Celtic) are a defensive feudal people seeded in forest, dense forest, grassland. They prize law, honor, tradition, lean toward the military sphere, and field light_infantry, light_cavalry, archers. Outsiders are met as wary; their patrons touch law, nature, wisdom."
